Nonprofit or educational status alone does not make commercial activity
Noncommercial Use. Unrestricted donations that do not buy a service or benefit
do not by themselves make an otherwise qualifying activity commercial.

"Commercial Use" includes paid consulting or client work; use in or to support
a monetized product, service, SaaS, API, hosted or managed service; internal
business operations; and evaluation, research or deployment by, for, or on
behalf of a for-profit enterprise. Contractors and affiliates acting for such
